      <div class="zl"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="2" y="6" width="14" height="12" rx="2"/><path d="M16 10l6-3.5v11L16 14"/></svg>Clase en vivo disponible</div>
